","content":"`fabric: ring`, three nodes, QSFP triangle. **Not** “2-node plus spark2 with pair env” —\ncabling and Job env: LiteLLM rounded stack."},"773":{"id":"/getting-started-37","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","bazel","k3s","ansible","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#step-1--topology-file-inventory","content":"`fabric: switch` + `switch:` block (CRS804-4DDQ-hRM `port_map`, one entry per node; 5 nodes\nuse breakout lanes `sfpplus4a`/`sfpplus4b`). Do **not** paste 2-node `NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`\nonto switch hops without reading Interconnect & NCCL."},"774":{"id":"/getting-started-38","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","bazel","k3s","ansible","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#step-1--topology-file-inventory","content":"Any node may be the orchestrator — see Choose topology → Pick your orchestrator."},"775":{"id":"/getting-started-39","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","bazel","k3s","ansible","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#step-1--topology-file-inventory","content":"Verify:"},"776":{"id":"/getting-started-40","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","bazel","k3s","ansible","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#step-1--topology-file-inventory","content":"Expected: pong on every host. If not: SSH keys, management firewall, console `ip a`."},"777":{"id":"/getting-started-41","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","bazel","k3s","ansible","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#step-1--topology-file-inventory","content":"Still prefer a manual `hosts.ini`? `cp ansible/inventory/hosts.ini.example ansible/inventory/hosts.ini`\nand edit it — the classic path still works, it just skips the generated netplan / cloud-init."},"778":{"id":"/getting-started-42","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","bazel","k3s","ansible","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#step-2--cloud-init-physical-nodes","content"